Pare bundles a subset of the Android vector resources at weight 400, grade 0,
optical size 24. Default assets use fill 0; the selected navigation variants
use fill 1.

Modifications by Pare: local resource names, explicit monochrome fill and
Compose-owned tint. Upstream RTL auto-mirroring is preserved on arrow_back,
chevron_left, chevron_right and flag. Original path geometry is unchanged.
auto_awesome uses an equivalent scale group to normalize its original 24-unit
coordinates into the shared 960-unit viewport.

